      "name": "What is Knit by Machine?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Knit by Machine is a fresh, modern home for machine knitters. It offers clarity, confidence, and practical guidance without clutter or overwhelm—so you can get answers quickly and enjoy using your knitting machine."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Who is Knit by Machine for?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Knit by Machine is for any machine knitter—beginner, returner, or experienced—who wants clean design, quick answers, and tools that make knitting easier and more fun."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What will I find here?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Three main areas: Ask ’n Answer (ANA) for fast, straightforward answers; Skill & Technique Guides for step-by-step help; and Interactive Wizards that handle the math so you can focus on knitting."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are Interactive Wizards?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Interactive Wizards are smart calculators, pattern planners, and practice tools that take care of the numbers and technical details. You can spend more time knitting and less time crunching math."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How often is new content added?",
